      Q. 3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْرَنْطَمَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>elevated his
nose:</i> (K:) or <i>twisted it, and was silent, in his
anger:</i> (TA:) and <i>was proud and angry,</i> (K,
TA,) <i>raising his head.</i> (TA.)

